{'symbol': 'CINF', 'date': '2023-04-17 08:45:00', 'title': 'CINCINNATI FINANCIAL CORPORATION ANNOUNCES PRELIMINARY ESTIMATE FOR FIRST-QUARTER STORM LOSSES', 'text': 'CINCINNATI, APRIL 17, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CINCINNATI FINANCIAL CORPORATION (NASDAQ: CINF) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS CONSOLIDATED FIRST-QUARTER RESULTS ARE EXPECTED TO INCLUDE PRETAX CATASTROPHE LOSSES OF APPROXIMATELY $235 MILLION – REPRESENTING AN IMPACT ON THE FIRST-QUARTER 2023 COMBINED RATIO OF APPROXIMATELY 12.8 PERCENTAGE POINTS, BASED ON ESTIMATED PROPERTY CASUALTY EARNED PREMIUMS.'}